OL,3,AKrakow shooting suspect has died in
OL,4,Ahospital, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gunman suspected of killing six
OL,7,Fpeople in central Krakow and his
OL,8,Fparents and sister at their home has
OL,9,Fdied in hospital, Polish police say.
OL,11,FThe 24-year-old was injured after
OL,12,Fopening fire in central Krakow, the
OL,13,Fsecond largest city in Poland, on
OL,14,FSaturday, and died early on Monday
OL,15,Fmorning, police said.
OL,17,FArmed officers raced to the scene and
OL,18,Fengaged in a gunfight with the suspect,
OL,19,Fwho was shot within three minutes of
OL,20,Fthe attack beginning, preventing a
OL,21,Ffurther massacre, officials said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
