OL,3,AInside the French drug gangs recruiting
OL,4,Achildren to kill
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: Strong language and
OL,7,Fdescriptions of sexual violence
OL,9,FAlthough she had just bought hashish
OL,10,Ffrom a drug dealer, the woman decided
OL,11,Fto call the police.
OL,13,FIt was because, along with the illegal
OL,14,Fdrugs, she had been handed a note by
OL,15,Fthe young seller during their brief
OL,16,Fmeeting on a Marseille housing estate
OL,17,Fin 2022.
OL,19,F"We're being held captive and need
OL,20,Fhelp. We are 15-years-old," it read.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
